{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>KAUNA</strong> is a Finnish boomer shooter made with 90's retro style graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game, you find yourself enjoying a peaceful summer evening at your cottage when suddenly a portal appears from the depths of the lake, ruining your plans. Now, instead of relaxing, you must deal with demonic forces that have invaded your cottage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Your mission:</strong> reclaim your evening and get back to enjoying that <strong>sauna</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight your way through the underworld and get rid of the demons who dare to disrupt your peaceful life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classic 90's FPS game. No cover, no reloading\u2014just pure shooting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Single-player game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore diverse, themed maps, each with secrets to uncover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traditional set of weapons are helping the fight such as a sword, shotgun and grenade launcher.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find <strong>power ups</strong> to turn the odds in your favor!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ambient and Metal soundtrack by Antti Kokko</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3582660?t=1744388808","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3582660?t=1744388808","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582660/e75baa633e679b75f7a3bdbce6dc75f0c4cbc083/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744388808","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582660/e75baa633e679b75f7a3bdbce6dc75f0c4cbc083/ca